.TH GOPMGR 1 "August 2026" "GoPMgr" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
gopmgr \- local-first project controls desktop application
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gopmgr
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B GoPMgr
is a local-first desktop application for project controls, CPM scheduling,
charting, document export, and encrypted per-project storage.
.SH DATA
GoPMgr stores user data in its private application-data directory. A configured
.B XDG_DATA_HOME
location overrides the platform default.
.SH SEE ALSO
The installed Help Guide and https://github.com/draconianneocoder-cpu/GoPMgr
